use firn/tags

pomodoro is a Module
pomodoro is tagged tasks

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.pomodoro.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.pomodoro-gtk]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."pomodoro"."enable": enable "Pomodoro timer"
